 or residence 1704 85th street east lutheran church of christ the king tacoma pierce 98445 southeast nourish food pantries pet food personal grooming supplies', 'nourishpc.org', 0, 0, 'pierce-county-nourish-southeast-nourish-tacoma-bcd8846c');
